     "diagnosis": "- grasp({'source': 'geometry (fingers across the short side)', 'x': -0.0358, 'y': -0.0951, 'height': 0.006, 'yaw': 0.975, 'score': None, 'id': 0, 'object': 'yellow_pen', 'squeeze_width': 0.0107, 'fits_open_fingers': True, 'object_height': 0.0119, 'object_center': [-0.0358, -0.0951], 'object_long_axis_yaw': -0.596, 'object_footprint': [0.1379, 0.0111]},) -> holding_something=True.\n- The grip point was -0.006 m relative to the object's top surface (grasp_height 0.006 vs object height 0.012); the fingers only grip what is below the grip point.\n- The fingertip line (yaw) was 90 degrees from the object's long axis, so the fingers squeezed across a 0.011 m extent of the object (the open fingers are 0.08 m apart; footprint is 0.138 along long_axis_yaw x 0.011 along short_axis_yaw).\n- Call 4 move_gripper(0.0186, -0.0084, 1.0) failed: {'reason': 'unreachable_pose', 'target': [0.0186, -0.0084, 1.0], 'ik_residual': 0.1344, 'hint': 'try another approach direction, finger axis or position (solve_ik checks without moving)'}.\n- At the grasp the gripper yaw (finger direction) was 0.975 rad while yellow_pen's long axis was -0.596 rad: 90.0 degrees apart.\n- The last carry_to used gripper yaw 0.975 rad.",
     "lesson": "Avoid using horizontal approach vectors when reorienting above the holder, and instead tilt or lower the pen using reachable downward or standard approach orientations."
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "code": "obs = observe()\ntable_z = obs[\"table_z\"]\nholder = obs[\"zones\"][\"magenta_holder\"]\nhx, hy, hz = holder[\"center\"]\nrim_h = holder.get(\"rim_height\", 0.08)\n\n# The gripper is already holding the yellow pen!\n# Check gripper state\nif not obs[\"gripper\"][\"holding_something\"]:\n    cands = grasp_candidates(\"yellow_pen\")\n    cand = min(cands, key=lambda c: c[\"squeeze_width\"])\n    grasp(cand)\n\n# Tilt gripper so the pen (along side vector) becomes vertical.\n# Side = approach x finger_axis.\n# If approach = [0, 0, -1], side is horizontal.\n# To make side vertical (pointing along -z), approach can be [cos(a), sin(a), 0] or tilted downwards.\n# Let's test IK with tilted approach or pitch.\n# A downward-slanted approach: e.g. approach=[0, 0.707, -0.707], finger_axis=[1, 0, 0] -> side = [-0.707, 0, -0.707] (partially vertical).\n# Even better: pitch around finger axis or test candidate orientations using solve_ik.\ntarget_z = table_z + rim_h + 0.10\n\n# Search for a reachable orientation where the pen is nearly vertical (side_z is large negative)\nbest_pose = None\nbest_score = 0.0\n\nfor angle in [math.pi / 4, math.pi / 3, math.pi / 2, 2 * math.pi / 3, 3 * math.pi / 4]:\n    # approach tilted down/forward, or approach down with roll/pitch\n    for yaw_rot in [0.0, math.pi / 4, math.pi / 2, 3 * math.pi / 4, math.pi, -math.pi / 4, -math.pi / 2]:\n        # Let approach point horizontally or at an angle\n        # If approach is tilted by theta from vertical down [0, 0, -1]:\n        app = [math.sin(angle) * math.cos(yaw_rot), math.sin(angle) * math.sin(yaw_rot), -math.cos(angle)]\n        # choose finger axis perpendicular to approach in horizontal plane\n        fx = -math.sin(yaw_rot)\n        fy = math.cos(yaw_rot)\n        fz = 0.0\n        # side = app x finger\n        # side_z = app_x * fy - app_y * fx = math.sin(angle)*(cos^2 + sin^2) = math.sin(angle)\n        # So pen tilts by angle from horizontal! If angle=pi/2, side is fully vertical!\n        ik = solve_ik(hx, hy, target_z, approach=app, finger_axis=[fx, fy, fz])\n        if ik.get(\"reachable\"):\n            score = abs(math.sin(angle))\n            if score > best_score:\n                best_score = score\n                best_pose = (app, [fx, fy, fz], target_z)\n\nif best_pose is not None:\n    app, fax, tz = best_pose\n    move_gripper(hx, hy, tz + 0.08, approach=app, finger_axis=fax, path=\"joint\")\n    move_gripper(hx, hy, tz, approach=app, finger_axis=fax, path=\"line\")\n    move_by(dz=-0.04)\nelse:\n    # Fallback to direct carry above holder rim and release\n    carry_to(hx, hy, height=rim_h + 0.10)\n    lower_until_contact()\n\nopen_gripper()\nretreat(dz=0.15)\ngo_home()\ncheck(\"yellow_pen\", \"magenta_holder\")",
